# MSBuild arguments that make lint-csharp passes to dotnet build. Lines that start with # are ignored.
# The .NET analysers run in Recommended mode with nullable reference types enabled, and every warning fails the build.
# The rules turned off ask for things this task does not want: localised strings, CLS compliance,
# internal-only types, no underscores in test names, null checks that nullable types already make, and ConfigureAwait.
-p:Nullable=enable
-p:AnalysisLevel=latest
-p:AnalysisMode=Recommended
-p:TreatWarningsAsErrors=true
-p:NoWarn=CA1014%3BCA1062%3BCA1303%3BCA1515%3BCA1707%3BCA2007
